WEBVTT

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:16.080
Sorry, you must...

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:21.630
be thinking that came out of nowhere, huh?

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:25.040
That was lame, right? I'm sitting here
in a hospital bed and all...

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.130
Thanks.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:34.040
I'm flattered.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:38.750
But...

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:43.630
I'm sorry.

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:50.210
I don't feel the same way
about you, Haida.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:54.210
It's not that I don't like you.

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:59.080
I'm just not ready for something like that
at the moment.

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:03.500
I'm sure there's someone out there
who is much better for you than me.

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:16.920
Just forget about it already...

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.290
Not bad.

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:12.290
LOOKS TOO GOOD TO EAT

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:16.580
<i>I've been hooked on Instagram lately.</i>

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:20.460
<i>I don't particularly stand out at work</i>
<i>or in my private life...</i>

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:22.920
<i>but when I post cute pictures,</i>

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:25.250
<i>I get validation from lots of people.</i>

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:28.790
1 LIKE

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:30.670
<i>People whose faces I don't even know</i>

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:33.500
<i>are cheering me on</i>
<i>with their "likes" from afar.</i>

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:36.460
LIKES

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:46.210
It's nothing special.

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:48.080
This is 1,800 yen?

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:56.040
You got 54 "likes," huh?

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:58.630
Well, it's an improvement.

00:02:58.710 --> 00:02:59.920
Thank you, coach!

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:02.330
I owe it all to your helpful pointers!

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:04.580
-You're not quite there yet.
-What?

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.710
You're not putting any thought
into your shots.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.420
Take this pic, for example.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:12.210
Some old guy's head
is totally in the frame.

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:13.290
Argh!

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:14.540
In this case...

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:17.880
first, you should change the angle
to cut him out.

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:20.540
<i>Use the light from the window</i>
<i>as a half-backlight.</i>

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:23.380
<i>Make the subject pop</i>
<i>by blurring the background,</i>

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:25.250
<i>and add a little finishing touch.</i>

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:28.210
<i>Wow! It looks even more mouth-watering!</i>

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:30.420
<i>With that, your "likes" will double.</i>

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:32.790
Coach, you're amazing!

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:35.130
Now, let's work on your selfies.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:38.670
What the heck is this?
It's absolutely terrible!

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:40.960
Yeah, I'm not good with selfies.

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:43.580
TEA ROOM

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:47.170
Selfie, dessert, latte art.
Selfie, dessert, latte art.

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:51.080
Selfie, dessert. Selfie, dessert.
Selfie, selfie, thigh pic.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.210
What the heck?

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:54.960
Don't you see?

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:57.040
If you ignore the reserved selfies
and thigh pics,

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:59.290
don't these just scream of Tsunoda?

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:03.290
I never thought I'd end up
needing to monitor Retsuko.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:07.250
Just leave her alone.
Everyone uses Instagram these days.

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:09.460
-How naive.
-What?

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:14.130
Based on the numerous cases I've seen
during my time as an Instagram cop...

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:19.330
even Instagram girls who start out modest
become increasingly self-conscious,

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:22.750
and they succumb to the dark side
in their greed for more "likes."

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:26.210
<i>Before long,</i>
<i>they're shamelessly exposing their thighs.</i>

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:30.960
Then they treat the guys that
flock to them like they're disposable.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:33.210
Retsuko isn't like that!

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:34.630
True.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:36.790
<i>Still...</i>

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:40.540
<i>sometimes that girl gets a bit</i>
<i>in over her head.</i>

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:43.580
<i>All I'm saying is that I just hope...</i>

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.790
<i>it doesn't get out of control.</i>

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:51.880
Good grief!

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:54.790
No matter where you go
at this time of year, it's all jingles.

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:56.330
My ears hurt!

00:04:56.710 --> 00:04:59.250
-Right, Komiya?
-Oh, absolutely, Mr. Ton!

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:02.500
Everyone is acting like a fool!

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:08.750
Who cares about Christmas?
In Japan, we've got Obon and New Year's!

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:10.420
I completely agree!

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:12.960
Obon and New Year's!

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:15.130
Obon and New Year's!

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:17.960
Obon and New Year's...

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.880
It will be Christmas soon.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:21.830
Yeah, I can't believe it.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.290
Are you spending Christmas
with your family?

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:26.250
I sure am.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:29.290
Every year, I go through so much trouble
to hide presents from my kids.

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:33.630
Oh, I bet! When I was a kid,
I used to search all over our house.

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:35.630
I guess all kids are the same.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.170
<i>Last year,</i>

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:41.040
<i>I buried the presents deep underground</i>
<i>in a forest, two kilometers away,</i>

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:42.540
<i>so they wouldn't be found,</i>

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:45.460
<i>but my kids figured out the location</i>
<i>after spotting red soil on my shoes,</i>

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:48.080
<i>and dug them up on Christmas Eve.</i>

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:53.080
What in the world? That's too funny!

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:56.790
What are you doing
on Christmas Eve, Haida?

00:05:58.670 --> 00:05:59.500
Uh...

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:03.500
I'm just gonna have a little party
or something with my buddies.

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:06.460
Oh, that sounds like fun.

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:08.880
What about you, Retsuko?

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:10.670
Oh, me?

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:13.170
I'm...

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:18.920
-I forgot...
-Huh?

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:21.040
All this talk of Christmas

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:23.540
has reminded me that I found
a new restaurant online yesterday!

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:26.540
Their Christmas menu
is available for a limited time only.

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:28.540
It's so cute
and I was planning to go today.

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:30.580
Oh, I see.

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:32.750
Where is this place?

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:34.420
In Kamakura.

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.040
Kamakura?

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:38.630
Well, I'm off now!

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:41.630
You're going there now?

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:45.250
It begins as a hobby, but soon,
posting pics becomes an obligation.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:46.920
Before you know it,

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:51.040
she'll be going out of her way
to a café in a different prefecture,

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:52.580
just to post a single pic.

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:55.710
It's begun.

00:06:56.170 --> 00:06:58.170
She's stuck in the bottomless pit
that is Instagram!

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:00.170
We're gonna get a complaint
from Instagram.

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:13.000
3 LIKES

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:19.330
<i>Retsuko.</i>

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:21.420
<i>Retsuko!</i>

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:25.330
Retsuko, do you have
any plans for Christmas Eve?

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:26.750
What?

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:28.290
No...

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:30.670
I haven't made any plans yet.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:35.750
How can you be so calm?
Christmas Eve is less than a week away!

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:36.920
Yeah...

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:40.250
<i>A special date!</i>
<i>A party with your closest friends!</i>

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:44.630
No other event is more important
for Instagram girls than Christmas Eve.

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:47.420
Can't I just spend time at home
with my family?

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:48.330
No.

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:52.250
<i>Don't you get it? Your private life</i>
<i>is no longer yours alone.</i>

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:53.790
<i>It belongs to everyone!</i>

00:07:54.460 --> 00:07:57.290
Who would be interested
in a boring, conventional Christmas?

00:07:57.380 --> 00:07:58.630
Who would give that "likes"?

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:02.080
Bigger! Grander! Pull out all the stops.

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:07.130
Broadcast your glamorous lifestyle
to the world and share your happiness!

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:10.130
That's our duty as Instagram girls.

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:12.920
Well, good luck!

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:15.380
I'll...

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:16.880
I'll do my best.

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:22.040
I know this is off topic,
but I was wondering,

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:26.000
do you two have any plans
for Christmas Eve?

00:08:26.920 --> 00:08:28.830
If you'd like, maybe we could all...

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:31.750
-Oh, sorry! I've already made plans.
-Huh?

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:34.500
What about you, Washimi?

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:37.170
I already have plans, of course.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:42.290
What? Don't tell me
you haven't made any plans yet, Retsuko!

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:43.580
Are you insane?

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:45.710
A woman alone on Christmas Eve
will freeze to death!

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:48.250
Don't put so much pressure on me!

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.670
Anyway, what sort of plans do you have?

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:56.250
We... have... dates!

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:57.670
Ah...

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:07.750
<i>I've completely missed the mark.</i>

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:11.540
<i>I wish someone</i>
<i>would invite me to something...</i>

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:26.210
Why don't you come to the party?

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:31.290
Oh, you might not know everyone there,
but you'll be fine! Fenneko's coming, too.

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:33.580
What are you saying
about me going somewhere?

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:38.380
The Christmas Eve party, of course!

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:41.960
Huh? I've not heard anything about this.
Christmas Eve is today!

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:44.460
You can't just spring this on me now.

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:48.080
I wanna invite Retsuko.

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:50.080
Help me out!

00:09:51.210 --> 00:09:53.040
She'll just turn you down again,

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:54.920
like before.

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:57.460
GREEN TEA

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:05.630
That was a long time ago.

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:08.460
What's wrong with trying again?

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.790
TEA ROOM

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:15.750
<i>Sorry, I can't do Christmas Eve.</i>
<i>It's been pretty busy at work.</i>

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:18.580
Even Puko is busy.

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:20.580
Yo, Retsuko!

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:22.960
Huh? Oh, Haida.

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:25.500
I was just about
to get myself some coffee.

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:31.290
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:33.790
<i>Isn't there anyone else I can invite out?</i>

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:38.000
Say, Retsuko...

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:39.710
Hmm? What is it?

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:41.580
Uh, so...

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:49.960
<i>Sorry...</i>

00:10:57.710 --> 00:10:58.580
Oh...

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:00.500
we're out of coffee.

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:05.170
Retsuko!

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:07.420
How many hours does it take to make tea?

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:09.290
Sorry! I'm coming!

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:11.880
OK, slow down. Take your time and hurry!

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:18.750
Oh, aren't you going home, Retsuko?

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:21.380
As soon as I'm done with this.

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:24.250
OK, then. See you! Have a nice Christmas!

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:27.040
Bye-bye to you, too, Haida!

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:27.960
Take care.

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:43.710
<i>It's December 24th, Christmas Eve...</i>

00:11:45.210 --> 00:11:46.830
<i>and I still have no plans!</i>

00:11:48.790 --> 00:11:51.630
<i>What can I post to Instagram?</i>

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:54.420
<i>Let's see...</i>

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:59.250
<i>"Restaurant with Christmas dinner option.</i>
<i>Availability for one..."</i>

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:01.830
No, no.

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:04.040
<i>I've got to finish this first.</i>

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:07.040
<i>It's fine. It will all work out.</i>

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:12.580
<i>After all, Christmas brings joy</i>
<i>to everyone, equally.</i>

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:15.130
<i>Huh?</i>

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:17.420
What? Huh?

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:25.420
Jingle-jingle-jingle!

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:27.670
Merry Christmas!

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:35.420
Get it done today.

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:40.670
Jingle-jingle-jingle!

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:43.040
<i>My Christmas Eve...</i>

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:46.040
<i>is over.</i>

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:18.170
5,359 LIKES
DINNER WITH BAE TONIGHT

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:19.670
Why is it just me?

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:22.250
Why is it just me?

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:27.130
<i>Merry Christmas!</i>

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:29.290
<i>I can still do it! Battling alone!</i>

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:31.750
<i>If I give in now, it's seriously over</i>

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.460
<i>Social media! Social media!</i>

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:36.080
<i>It's where I document my Christmas Eve</i>

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:39.960
<i>Only the number of "likes" I receive</i>
<i>Makes me feel alive</i>

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:44.170
<i>Only the number of "likes" I receive</i>
<i>Makes me feel alive</i>

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:55.290
RETSU

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:10.540
I can't help but feel
a bit out of place here.

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:11.670
Oh, come on. It's fine.

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:14.630
-Just keep me company.
-Quit being clingy. You're so annoying.

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.250
That's why you got turned down by Retsuko.

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:26.500
What, are you patrolling again?

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:27.460
It's nothing.

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:29.290
Isn't that Retsuko's Instagram?

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:30.960
I said, it's nothing!

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:32.670
Come on. Just let me see!

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:33.710
Oh!

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:41.880
It looks like
she's having dinner at a restaurant.

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:52.830
Don't lose your head!
She could be by herself, you know?

00:14:52.920 --> 00:14:56.790
And taking pictures with an extra glass?
She's definitely with some guy!

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:01.460
Dammit!
This is the worst Christmas Eve ever!

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:07.250
Huh?

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:11.420
Haida.

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:14.040
Do you have your laptop with you?

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:20.750
<i>Look, everyone.</i>

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:24.080
<i>Look at my joyful Christmas.</i>

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:29.130
Take a look at this, Haida.

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:30.580
I don't wanna see it.

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:31.880
Just look!

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:35.920
At first glance, this photo
looks well-lit and pretty, right?

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:38.130
Because it's a restaurant
with ambiance, right?

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:39.040
Look closely!

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:41.170
This wine glass...

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:42.790
looks cheap.

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:44.460
Huh?

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:48.130
<i>Normal glasses are smooth,</i>
<i>here, at the stem, right?</i>

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:52.000
<i>The one in the picture</i>
<i>is a plastic cup that you assemble.</i>

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:53.420
What does that mean?

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:55.880
And this seafood dish...

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:58.830
It's arranged to look like
a course you'd eat at a restaurant, but...

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:04.290
Is that...

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:05.210
mackerel?

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:07.710
Is it the mackerel in miso sauce
you get at convenience stores?

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:08.790
The one that's 258 yen!

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:10.250
I love that stuff!

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:11.290
Yep, it's good stuff.

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:16.290
Is that a reflection in the wine glass?

00:16:16.380 --> 00:16:17.380
Let's see...

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:19.630
If we adjust the brightness
and contrast...

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:26.000
It's Retsuko!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:29.790
She's wearing her uniform.
This was posted at 8:37 p.m.

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:31.210
That means...

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:34.580
that Mr. Ton ordered her to work overtime.

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:37.670
Irritated that she has no pic to post,

00:16:38.170 --> 00:16:40.290
she goes to a convenience store
for materials.

00:16:40.380 --> 00:16:42.750
<i>Using the techniques</i>
<i>she's learned from Tsunoda,</i>

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:45.710
<i>she fabricates an image</i>
<i>that gives off the illusion of happiness.</i>

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:51.000
She does all of this to get "likes,"
in order to feel validated.

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:53.130
Huh?

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:56.380
Hey, Haida!

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:02.210
ACCOUNTING DEPARTMENT

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.830
Retsuko, let me help...

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:19.040
How could he force me to wait in
this freezing cold, only to cancel on me?

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:21.750
I figured that I'd try meeting him,
but he was unbearably dull.

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:24.330
I should have poured water
over his head before I left.

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:27.250
I know that
must have been really difficult,

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:30.040
but could you please put me down?

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:32.540
Oh, I'm so hungry!

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:33.830
Yeah.

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:36.630
What do you say to a Christmas dinner
with just us three girls?

00:17:37.130 --> 00:17:39.670
What? Do you know a good restaurant?

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:41.670
Leave it to us.

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:45.000
Christmas dinner!

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:48.580
STANDING SOBA NOODLE BAR

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:50.580
<i>A standing soba noodle bar?</i>

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:52.710
Let's go in.

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:54.130
Are you two serious?

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:58.790
It's Christmas Eve! It's a special night.
Why would we go for standing soba?

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:00.630
It's cheap, fast, and hot!

00:18:01.670 --> 00:18:02.670
Welcome!

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:05.670
-I'll have the hot soba.
-OK.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:06.920
-Me, too.
-OK.

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:11.580
None for me.

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:13.080
There's nothing fancy about this.

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:15.750
There's no feeling of joy.

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:20.960
Three ladies, hungry,
in the frigid evening air.

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:24.040
Before them,
they have hot bowls of noodle soup.

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:27.790
If this isn't joy, what would you call it?

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:33.210
Who cares about Christmas?

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:35.500
We have Obon and New Year's.

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:46.500
I'll have one, too!

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:49.210
You've got it. Merry Christmas!

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:50.540
Your thumb!

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:54.290
STANDING SOBA NOODLE BAR

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:00.580
Thank you for your purchase!

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:02.330
Thanks.

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:07.880
Mommy, thanks for our presents!

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:10.170
What, have you dug them up already?

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:14.130
Auntie made sure
she got you a present, you know.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:17.250
I'll bring it with me at New Year's,
so just wait until then.

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:34.920
So you know that actor, Inujo?
I totally know him.

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:40.210
I also know that soccer player, Nekomura.
I have loads of acquaintances.

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:43.250
It was like, "Long time, no see!
Why don't we pop on over to Dubai..."

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:45.000
CHRISTMAS DINNER, PART TWO

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:47.580
...on another acquaintance's
private jet, and...

00:19:47.670 --> 00:19:48.630
Hey, are you listening?

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:56.670
THANK YOU FOR A NICE MEAL

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:01.710
I'M STUFFED

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:03.130
Thanks for the noodles!

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:04.040
Anytime!

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:05.420
Merry Christmas!

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:07.290
Merry Christmas!

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:12.920
Oh.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:13.830
Haida?

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:15.630
Oh!

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:20.290
What are you doing?
Didn't you say you were going to a party?

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:24.210
No, I was just wandering around...

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:26.880
You're the guy
from Retsuko's department, right?

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:30.790
We were just having a Christmas dinner.
Isn't that right?

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:35.380
Let's head home, Gori.

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:38.670
What? Why? Aren't we going for karaoke?

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:40.420
-Don't worry about it!
-What?

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:41.670
Sorry, Retsuko.

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:43.920
We just remembered
that we have something to do.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:52.420
Merry Christmas.
